    "h1": {
      "en": "Frame",
      "zh": "框架"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "Four aluminum 2040 extrusions form the base frame. Every other part is installed on it. Make sure that all four corners are square. They are the foundation for accurate motion later.",
      "zh": "四根 2040 铝型材组成底座框架。其余零件都装在框架上。确认框架四角成直角。方正的框架是后续运动精度的基础。"
    }
  },
