          "en": "Load the T-nuts first",
          "zh": "先装滑块螺母"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Before you square the frame, slide every T-nut into its slot.",
          "zh": "校正框架四角前，先把每颗滑块螺母滑入型材槽。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; bottom:70mm; width:80mm;"
