    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Reinforce the frame",
          "zh": "框架加固"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "One flat bracket reinforces each corner. 1. Put 2 M5×10 BHCS through the bracket. 2. Thread a drop-in T-nut loosely onto each. 3. Put the bracket with its nuts into the frame corner. 4. Tighten both screws.",
          "zh": "每角用一块一字连接板加固。1. 把 2 颗 M5×10 半圆头螺栓穿过连接板。2. 各拧上船形螺母，暂不拧紧。3. 把连接板连同螺母放入框架转角。4. 拧紧螺栓。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:100mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
