          "en": "Feet point down",
          "zh": "支脚朝下"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The bumpers are the feet of the machine. Install them under the four corners of the frame.",
          "zh": "橡胶脚垫是机器的支脚。装在框架底面四角。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:100mm; width:78mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Bumper screws",
          "zh": "脚垫螺栓"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "If the bumpers came with their own screws, use those screws. They are the right size.",
          "zh": "如果脚垫自带螺栓，直接使用自带螺栓，尺寸相符。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:135mm; top:30mm; width:70mm;"
